  "text_md": "Table 30. Reserved Variable Names\n\nSelect Field in Record Format Database file . . . . . . : MLTFMT\n\nLibrary . . . . . . . . : SENDAI Record Format . . . . . . : MLTFMT Type an option, press Enter.\n\n1=Select\n\nOpt Field Length Type Text AREA 8 C Area products developed PRICE 3 P Price of the product PRODCT 12 C Product name SIZE 4 P Size\n\nBottom F5=Refresh F11=Select reserved variable F12=Cancel\n\nSelect Reserved Variable Name Type option, press Enter.\n\n1=Select\n\n# Opt Reserved variable name Description\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>*DATE</th>\n    <th>Job date</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>*TIME</td>\n    <td>Job time</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>*PAGNBR</td>\n    <td>Page number</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>*RCDNBR</td>\n    <td>Record number</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>*DBFIL</td>\n    <td>Database file name</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>*DBLIB</td>\n    <td>Database library name</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>*DBMBR</td>\n    <td>Database member name</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nF5=Refresh F11=Select field F12=Cancel\n\n",
